# covgap_svc_heap_reply_wraps: HeapTextureSizeAndAlign (64) with its 16-byte reply at task VA 2^64 - 16. In-process the range check refuses it before anything. The service rounds the reply out to whole pages first, and the page end wraps to 0, so it asks for one page at 2^64 - 0x4000, whose end overflows the range check. It faults in every setup; the next 64, with its reply in the task, completes. Host values (the size and alignment Metal reports).
